              "placeholder": "",
              "required": true,
              "reveal": {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A monitoring tool may need not only the minimum latency number but also the chain of services on that route. Predecessor updates during successful relaxation preserve enough information to reconstruct that route afterward.",
